# GUI comparison of fixed cruise and pyBADA-selected aerodynamic configuration.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-configmode-gui
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA CONFIGURATION MODE GUI COMPARISON ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Red aircraft force CR. Blue aircraft delegate configuration selection to pyBADA.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST INFO All aircraft use TEM with envelope policy OFF so this compares propagation only.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE CRC,A320-232,41.28,2.05,90,1500,160
00:00:01.10>CRE PYC,A320-232,41.30,2.05,90,1500,160
00:00:01.20>CRE CRD,A320-232,41.34,2.05,90,5000,180
00:00:01.30>CRE PYD,A320-232,41.36,2.05,90,5000,180
00:00:01.40>DYNAMICS CRC TEM
00:00:01.45>DYNAMICS PYC TEM
00:00:01.50>DYNAMICS CRD TEM
00:00:01.55>DYNAMICS PYD TEM
00:00:01.60>BADACONFIG CRC CRUISE
00:00:01.65>BADACONFIG PYC PYBADA
00:00:01.70>BADACONFIG CRD CRUISE
00:00:01.75>BADACONFIG PYD PYBADA
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE CRC OFF
00:00:01.82>ENVELOPE PYC OFF
00:00:01.84>ENVELOPE CRD OFF
00:00:01.86>ENVELOPE PYD OFF
00:00:02.00>PAN 41.32 2.15
00:00:02.10>ZOOM 12
00:00:02.20>TRAIL ON 0.20
00:00:02.30>TRAIL CRC RED
00:00:02.35>TRAIL CRD RED
00:00:02.40>TRAIL PYC BLUE
00:00:02.45>TRAIL PYD BLUE
00:00:02.60>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-configmode-gui.csv
00:00:03.00>ECHO TEST ACTION CRC and PYC climb from 1500 ft toward FL100 at identical initial state.
00:00:03.05>ECHO TEST ACTION CRD and PYD descend from 5000 ft toward 1000 ft at identical initial state.
00:00:03.10>ALT CRC FL100
00:00:03.15>ALT PYC FL100
00:00:03.20>ALT CRD 1000
00:00:03.25>ALT PYD 1000
00:00:04.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT PERFSTATUS shows configuration_mode CRUISE and config CR for red aircraft.
00:00:04.05>ECHO TEST EXPECT Blue aircraft show configuration_mode PYBADA and pyBADA-selected config and HLid.
00:00:04.10>PERFSTATUS CRC CURRENT
00:00:04.20>PERFSTATUS PYC CURRENT
00:00:04.30>PERFSTATUS CRD CURRENT
00:00:04.40>PERFSTATUS PYD CURRENT
00:00:05.10>PERFSTATUS CRC BOUNDS
00:00:05.20>PERFSTATUS PYC BOUNDS
00:00:05.30>PERFSTATUS CRD BOUNDS
00:00:05.40>PERFSTATUS PYD BOUNDS
00:00:20.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Rechecking configuration and performance after propagation.
00:00:20.10>PERFSTATUS CRC CURRENT
00:00:20.20>PERFSTATUS PYC CURRENT
00:00:20.30>PERFSTATUS CRD CURRENT
00:00:20.40>PERFSTATUS PYD CURRENT
00:00:21.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT Any red-blue altitude or speed separation is caused by configuration-dependent TEM performance.
00:00:21.10>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:21.20>ECHO TEST INFO Evidence is saved to output/pybada-configmode-gui.csv.
00:00:21.30>ECHO TEST INFO Simulation remains paused for GUI inspection. Use OP to continue.
00:00:22.00>HOLD
